vides integrated brownfield and offshore marine services for the upstream oil and gas industry in Malaysia. It operates through Services, Marine Assets, and Upstream segments. The company engages in the exploration, development, and production of crude oil and petroleum resources; and ownership and supply of vessels. It also offers hook-up, commissioning and maintenance, project management, technical and other services, fabrication, subsea and underwater, as well as trading and engineering services; and owns and operates accommodation and work barges, workboats, anchor handling tug supply (AHTS) vessels, and mobile offshore production units (MOPU). In addition, the company explores, develops, and produces petroleum in Block SK433 located in onshore Sarawak; and Banang small field located in offshore Terengganu, Malaysia. Further, it involves production, operation, and maintenance services; storage and offloading facilities; wells and reservoir surveillance; production planning and forecasting; and inventory and warehousing management activities for an oil field. Additionally, the company engages in the design and fabrication of process equipment; packaging and supply of engineered equipment for the oil and gas industry; and design, fabrication, supply, and installation of industrial boilers and ancillary equipment. Petra Energy Berhad was founded in 1988 and is headquartered in Petaling Jaya, Malaysia.","zh":"Petra Energy Berhad 是一家投资控股公司，为马来西亚上游石油和天然气行业提供综合棕地及海上海事服务。公司成立于1988年，总部位于马来西亚八打灵再也，通过服务、海事资产和上游三个板块运营。","lines":["服务：提供连接、调试与维护、项目管理、技术、制造、海底与水下工程、贸易及工程服务，客户为上游油气行业。","海事资产：拥有和运营住宿与工作驳船、工作船、锚作拖轮供应船（AHTS）及移动式海上生产装置（MOPU），并提供船舶所有权和供应。","上游：在马来西亚砂拉越陆上SK433区块和丁加奴近海Banang小油田进行原油和石油资源的勘探、开发与生产。","生产运营与维护：为油田提供生产、运营与维护服务，包括储存与卸货设施、油井与油藏监测、生产计划与预测、库存与仓储管理。","工程与制造：设计和制造工艺设备，为油气行业包装和供应工程设备，以及设计、制造、供应和安装工业锅炉及辅助设备。"],"lines_en":["Services: Provides hook-up, commissioning and maintenance, project management, technical, fabrication, subsea and underwater, trading and engineering services to the upstream oil and gas industry.","Marine Assets: Owns and operates accommodation and work barges, workboats, anchor handling tug supply (AHTS) vessels, and mobile offshore production units (MOPU); involves ownership and supply of vessels.","Upstream: Engages in exploration, development, and production of crude oil and petroleum resources in Block SK433 onshore Sarawak and Banang small field offshore Terengganu, Malaysia.","Production Operation and Maintenance: Offers production, operation, and maintenance services for oil fields, including storage and offloading facilities, wells and reservoir surveillance, production planning and forecasting, and inventory and warehousing management.","Engineering and Fabrication: Designs and fabricates process equipment; packages and supplies engineered equipment for the oil and gas industry; designs, fabricates, supplies, and installs industrial boilers and ancillary equipment."]}}